msgid "⟪k:0⟫How... ⟪k:1⟫How did things end up this way?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comment... ⟪k:1⟫Comment les choses en sont-elles arrivées là ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B160FB80_A524_4386_B4F3_E09D32BB5AD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d822c5b4a6f42c3b1dd4b1924d12d9a75223b0d115e689f17ca68dc62d2a5e95
