#: scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a040ab9060c6e2584306f7c63198d27718abe725b4b8fb56eda36d0eee50a6ef
#. default-sha256: 9abcd91f2834fe2e6d7ae9852c91fa707a23854e3aa79c7ed08cfbfefa1ad911
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫was to go back to the way things used to be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tout ce que je voulais... ⟪k:1⟫c’était revenir aux jours heureux..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0a93378162f826734abccef5adc3646867106f80ad2c37988cd16ef5048431d2
#. default-sha256: acb4d40e485985b0ac8b553d0e2465341badac1515ce733d4f88b2bddd4f46d6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for us... ⟪k:1⟫to be able to smile around each other..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...que nous puissions... ⟪k:1⟫sourire ensemble à nouveau..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2061d9190c5f43dabe4bd7c45523b05f6b077ae348b544d39c386c09c088fe1
#. default-sha256: a8fd8074380c103afc96ce19bf144fee3eaa53e451f23a90b928e2c4c67e650a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It had been several days since Jacopo had locked her in the shed,⟪k:5⟫"
"and her day-to-day life was only growing more arduous."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Cela faisait plusieurs jours que Jacopo l’avait enfermée dans la remise,"
"⟪k:5⟫et sa vie au quotidien était de plus en plus pénible."

#: scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5971bd33801f71456fc4b96b4e534246b3bae9f90c80ef34621512dda206e08b
#. default-sha256: 1a5a51c0877e59be81ffcbbf0f6c056b9fd5ad923000f75db1a2aee8462c9629
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was under constant surveillance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elle était constamment sous surveillance."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3118f76aa834b2657305393b5d29b5f3bad34b97a73fae2b7c7cf7387dd2b0a5
#. default-sha256: 290009c8e34eab745c2f564ba86c2fd46e61da4ab2fe251e582fc9bbde59a901
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door was only unlocked to deliver her meals, three times a day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La porte n’était déverrouillée que trois fois par jour, lors des repas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a95ba2ab1cd88443e7c9dbef1c6ca3e9184950eb23600293363d2d8bfbdbcf70
#. default-sha256: 709a3ef50cbd8d1154158bcbd4afa565257961b5e08641b0b7c38203ca41eebe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And despite what an unfortunate situation their employer’s wife found herself in, the maids "
"chattered and gossiped and giggled freely."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et malgré la situation misérable dans laquelle la femme de leur patron se trouvait, les "
"servantes discutaient, jasaient et gloussaient librement."

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb92997e0f7aaa4c0b2051f6ccbc7aabbb522d49db0167398095b30ad70aecd2
#. default-sha256: 1f4c060396cf3c3f82f85fd8036f7a457cae1d6069d66bb14bc84d3c7b01bc2c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not even in the shadows, out of her presence—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the tactless young maidservants "
"whispered directly to the White-Haired Girl when they brought her meals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elles ne se cachaient même pas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ les jeunes servantes, sans aucun tact, parlaient "
"directement à la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs, quand elles lui apportaient le repas."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aad1fbdce307412f8a95d0d90e19aa9636ae4028880b21a02f403286794dbf33
#. default-sha256: 2cee9646346feb2a362ef0f3f493db49ce5e7fa78ccf5e82cc3cb2b755421b63
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Look at you, Madam. Caged away like cattle.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫« Regardez-vous, madame. Mise en cage, comme du bétail. »"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 410e5691c3b483ae0702a08ab6ae9aafdda52495a312fac855b16f4e2ca5fa82
#. default-sha256: 7a3bb22699320e94c6663de46a006c06a6b3a5badb2d1828ea06f275c76ffccf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could almost hear the sound of cracks forming in her heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’entendais presque le bruit des fissures qui se formaient dans son cœur."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbbbc8f33a483e226ac91c7fea1e1a18931943075ff511bc95c1602686d06f63
#. default-sha256: 02e87426fba4e9086dd912f82e5401459014629b19e0a83dbf46e16f52c3b851
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine she had gotten to the point where she was having difficulty merely holding herself "
"together. ⟪k:1⟫She had done nothing wrong, and yet she was forced to live this life of insults "
"and mockery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je pense qu’elle en était arrivée au point où elle avait même des difficultés à se tenir "
"simplement debout. ⟪k:1⟫Elle n’avait rien fait de mal, et pourtant elle était obligée de vivre "
"une vie d’insultes et de moqueries."

#: scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0971c2ea94c1e93dcb0a3791974a7c2f2e188ad34b2b2fe6a3d5d0bf699b6bc8
#. default-sha256: eb471ff1b45f09db9324c709218c493c4c15e81d9b0df70b5e14ad7606649397
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of ridicule."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫De railleries."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b5ece81ec50fec203976b1c0581b3d66afb6e8bcedee9e557acfbf1ec7144d8
#. default-sha256: 83d7cd4f8c47432a86b6a6f444315227767864b93137873050c94d30933fffd3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The only reason her tenuously held together spirit did not completely shatter was because "
"she still had her one and only ally."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La seule chose qui empêchait encore son esprit de voler en éclats était qu’elle avait "
"toujours sa seule et unique alliée."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d37dc1e5d2951ec5334f3bb69c8ed67287b22dbd75144a0c68e702edf68f55a
#. default-sha256: b38beb2406e9402ab82c5cd98e0d27e1cc1b8a2e3f53503e6a87b94ec578c022
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maid Maria volunteered to attend to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Maria se porta volontaire pour s’occuper de la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77a35db6536b0c5cce8fdb80b30aca31e46899dd564eba38245d50b8ba0afd0f
#. default-sha256: 78ed0ce103ab956fbb1d99da7015717fbe87e387873afaedec198d6850b4ba28
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria took over the duty of delivering her three meals, meaning the other maids stopped "
"coming by."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle se chargeait de lui apporter ses trois repas, ce qui veut dire que les autres servantes "
"finirent par ne plus venir."

#: scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 831cb4b09b5dd567ffa2659ef2b0511596fd22e8230b1a190e3ce43888f03b98
#. default-sha256: 2d469dd0b7e15e7f054344fe5687d981ffb92cc5472217f4e9a0ffb728b6e49c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that relieved the White-Haired Girl’s mental and emotional stress considerably."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et cela soulagea considérablement la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 548461c6d08151521a4ceefe4a95541d918a902f5872f24d6667160029ee7343
#. default-sha256: 98450cc10813ea42b826cdab6a7be06d46ae29a2d0e0eb3bc204e03f8502fd74
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria became her sole conversation partner, her sole companion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not leave "
"as soon as meals were finished, instead remaining in the shed with the White-Haired Girl for some "
"time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria devint sa seule partenaire de conversation, sa seule compagne.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Elle ne "
"partait pas dès que les repas étaient finis, non, elle restait un peu dans la remise pour tenir "
"compagnie à la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BCFD5ACC_E8B5_4165_9D19_82B98BCB3AEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d51ff7361133cb76cb212921f731582913c26d235052faaa1698edeaf296db14
