msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: deba212002e5b01af5743c2637f333e2099c94240a79a80c6c77514da6e55a19
#. default-sha256: f666a99e59d7e469f4b07ab9d818eb477f4d2cd4c9ea4dba0633b0bfd171e920
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫S-⟪k:2⟫So, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫Madam, how ’bout a funny story?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I flubbed up pretty "
"hard the other day. You wanna hear about that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A-⟪k:2⟫Alors, ⟪k:3⟫euh, ⟪k:4⟫madame, si j’vous racontais une histoire drôle ?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"J’ai fait une sacrée gaffe, l’autre jour. Vous voulez qu’j’vous la raconte ?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_378947F8_2A37_4B64_B4E0_BB55B07C4C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f9cc6cb8da0b3eff754ff312b9bca7d703d9de3e8508aa3b902c96c75123088
